-service/pull/101\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` rounded halves up (`ROUND_HALF_UP`), even though its own description says it uses banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, per FIN-212). That's why `tests/test_money.py` failed: for example, 2.665 rounded to 2.67 instead of the expected 2.66.\n- **Fix:** On branch `fix/banker-rounding-fin-212`, I changed it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. That one-line change is the only edit.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on commit 08d3cd5986.\n\nI haven't merged the PR, because merging into main needs a code owner's approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}